# Debian build output. `cd pkg-files && dpkg-buildpackage -b` drops the package
# and its metadata in the repo ROOT, because debian/rules reaches up with ../
# and so must run one level down from here. Nothing was ignored before, since
# nothing had ever built it -- see "Verify packaging" in .github/workflows.
*.deb
*.buildinfo
*.changes
pkg-files/debian/.debhelper/
pkg-files/debian/debhelper-build-stamp
pkg-files/debian/files
pkg-files/debian/*.debhelper.log
pkg-files/debian/*.substvars
pkg-files/debian/gigabyte-laptop-dkms/

# IDE/agent scratch
.cursor/
AGENT.md
